OL,3,ATrump says it would be 'foolish' to
OL,4,Areject AI 'riches' as markets hit by
OL,5,Afears of US tech slowdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe value of tech stocks has plummeted
OL,8,Faround the world amid fears of a
OL,9,Fslowdown in AI development
OL,11,FIt comes after the US midterm
OL,12,Felections, won by the Democrats, where
OL,13,Fdata centres became a key issue for
OL,14,Fvoters - BBC Verify looks at polling
OL,15,Fdata
OL,17,FUS President Donald Trump has restated
OL,18,Fhis support for the AI sector in a
OL,19,Fsocial media post, saying only "foolish
OL,20,Fleadership" would "say no to the riches
OL,21,Fthey bring"
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
