OL,3,ATrump says it would be 'foolish' to
OL,4,Areject AI 'riches' as markets hit by
OL,5,Afears of US tech slowdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Nasdaq index, of the largest tech
OL,8,Ffirms listed in the US, was down by
OL,9,Fmore than 5.5% on Thursday; Japan's
OL,10,FNikkei 225 was down 6.3% earlier; and
OL,11,Fthe UK's FTSE 100 index has fallen by
OL,12,F1.6%
OL,14,FDespite its dramatic drop, Nasdaq is
OL,15,Fstill higher now than it was last year
OL,16,F- all eyes will be on the US markets
OL,17,Fwhen they reopen at 09:30 ET / 14:30
OL,18,FGMT
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
